{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Lead Qualification & Outreach\n\n**Trigger:** POST to the webhook with `{ firstName, lastName, email, company, website, notes }`.\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Normalize the incoming payload\n2. Fetch + clean the company website\n3. GPT-5-mini agent scores ICP fit and drafts a personalized cold email (structured JSON)\n4. Respond to caller immediately with the analysis\n5. If fit >= 7: send email, ping Slack, log as *sent*\n6. Else: log as *skipped*\n\n**Configure before running:**\n- OpenAI credential on the model\n- Gmail OAuth2 on Send Personalized Email\n- Slack OAuth2 + channel on Notify Team\n- A Data Table named \"Leads\" (or similar) with columns matched in the two Data Table nodes",
        "height": 1080,
        "width": 2384,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "02b07caf-065a-47af-85d5-97c6d6cbb821",
      "name": "Sticky Note 3fa35847",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        192,
        -32
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "lead-qualify",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c2b975c7-8afa-410b-aa4c-039c63165e72",
      "name": "New Lead Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        240,
        400
      ],
      "webhookId": "e6b2ee97-4744-4729-8f7c-f7fd4f582f6b"
    },
